The upstream code is licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.
The import-meta-env transform was originally adapted upstream from
https://github.com/Codex-/swc-plugin-import-meta-env by Alex Miller (Apache-2.0).

Modifications: replaced SWC Rust/WASM visitors with SWC Next ESTree JavaScript
walkers, added lexical binding resolution, exposed extraction metadata through
the JavaScript API, and adapted upstream tests to the local plugin runner.
ICU message parsing uses @formatjs/icu-messageformat-parser.
